{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30199","headline":"老去也 · 薛逢","name":"老去也","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惆怅人生不满百，一事无成头雪白。\n回看幼累与老妻，俱是途中远行客。\n匣中旧镜照胆明，昔曾见我髭未生。\n朝巾暮栉不自省，老皮皴皱文纵横。\n合掌髻子蒜许大，此日方知非是我。\n暗数七旬能几何，不觉中肠热如火。\n老去也，争奈何，敲酒盏，唱短歌。\n短歌未竟日已没，月映西南庭树柯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30199.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30199","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}